{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38604","headline":"古锦裾六韵 · 吴融","name":"古锦裾六韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"濯水经何日，随风故有人。\n绿衣犹偪画，丹顶尚迷真。\n暗澹云沈古，青苍藓剥新。\n暎襟知惹泪，侵鞯想萦尘。\n掣曳无由睹，流传久自珍。\n武威应认得，牵挽几当春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38604.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38604","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}